{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "$ref": "#/somewhere"
    } 
  }
}
```

#### Ref with adjacent keywords

Original

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "$ref": "#/somewhere",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string"
    } 
  }
}
