Transformed

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "allOf": [
    {"$ref": "#/somewhere"}
  ],
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string"
    } 
  }
}
```

#### Ref with adjacent keywords and allOf

Original

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "$ref": "#/somewhere",
  "properties": {
    "name": {
      "type": "string"
    } 
  },
  "allOf": [
    {"$ref": "#/somewhereElse"}
  ] 
}
```

Transformed

```json
{
  "type": "object",
  "allOf": [
    {"$ref": "#/somewhere"},
